//! The `grid-column-end` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property specifies
//! a grid item's end position within the grid column by contributing a line, a span, or nothing
//! (automatic) to its grid placement, thereby specifying the block-end edge of its `grid area`.
//!
//! Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Grammar: <grid-line>
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid-2/#propdef-grid-column-end
//!
//! Author guide:
